        "TextSection": {
            "TextSectionType": "Definition",
            "Contents": "A rare developmental defect during embryogenesis characterized by abnormal arrangement of the thoraco-abdominal organs across the left-right axis of the body. By definition it does not include situs inversus totalis (total mirror-imagery)."
